This mirrors QSMC_Scanners.mqh - its arithmetic AND its fixed bucket
arrays, which is how the December/week-53 drop became visible. It also
runs against the real host now: MQL5/Indicators/QSMC_ScannerProbe.mq5.
It does NOT test
symbol discovery, Market Watch or CopyRates - those need a terminal.
It is not a backtest and produces no win rate. Press F7 to compile.
